{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46206","headline":"山居诗二十四首 二十 · 贯休","name":"山居诗二十四首 二十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自休自已自安排，常愿居山事偶谐。\n僧采树衣临绝壑，狖争山果落空阶。\n闲担茶器缘青障，静衲禅袍坐绿崖。\n虚作新诗反招隐，出来多与此心乖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46206.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46206","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}